  "segments": [
    {
      "line": 1,
      "text": "1.前往加纳村（72.70）与离对话，获得【蝎毒血清】。",
      "type": "step-acquisition",
      "sourceLines": [
        1
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 2,
      "text": "2.收集【红蝎毒】、【黄蝎毒】、【蓝蝎毒】，蝎毒掉率较低，请提前做好准备。",
      "type": "collection-step",
      "sourceLines": [
        2
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 3,
      "text": "◆收集地点：",
      "type": "collection-heading",
      "sourceLines": [
        3
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 4,
      "text": "【红蝎毒】：加纳村外鲶鱼洞窟（626.209）",
      "type": "item-source",
      "sourceLines": [
        4
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 5,
      "text": "【黄蝎毒】：加纳村外索奇亚（525.348）",
      "type": "item-source",
      "sourceLines": [
        5
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 6,
      "text": "【蓝蝎毒】：加纳村外索奇亚（582.327）",
      "type": "item-source",
      "sourceLines": [
        6
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 7,
      "text": "【蓝蝎毒】【黄蝎毒】混点：加纳村外索奇亚（582.327）附近",
      "type": "mixed-item-source",
      "sourceLines": [
        7
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 8,
      "text": "3.回到加纳村（72.70）对话，每人交出【红蝎毒】、【黄蝎毒】、【蓝蝎毒】获得【增效毒蝎血清】。",
      "type": "exchange-step",
      "sourceLines": [
        8
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 9,
      "text": "4.加纳村出南门至索奇亚沙漠寻找随机出现的黄色传送石。通过黄色传送石抵达砂漠之祠。",
      "type": "route-step",
      "sourceLines": [
        9
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 10,
      "text": "通过随机迷宫抵达沙漠之庙地下6楼。通过（14.13）处楼梯抵达沙漠之庙。",
      "type": "route-step",
      "sourceLines": [
        10
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 11,
      "text": "◆黄色传送石出现范围较大，约位于索奇亚沙漠（570~640.300~400）处区域：",
      "type": "search-area-note",
      "sourceLines": [
        11
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 12,
      "text": "◇快速寻找沙庙的方法：",
      "type": "search-guide-heading",
      "sourceLines": [
        12
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 13,
      "text": "按照579.309=>579.391=>598.391=>598.309=>617.309=>617.391大几率找到，",
      "type": "search-route-note",
      "sourceLines": [
        13
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 14,
      "text": "没有就再按照617.391=>631.391=>631.309寻找",
      "type": "search-route-note",
      "sourceLines": [
        14
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 15,
      "text": "◆砂漠之祠为随机迷宫，5层；魔物为Lv.25~27杀手蝎、木乃伊；迷宫刷新时间：6小时（仅供参考）",
      "type": "maze-note",
      "sourceLines": [
        15
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 16,
      "text": "◆沙漠之庙为固定迷宫，行走路线：",
      "type": "fixed-maze-note",
      "sourceLines": [
        16
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 17,
      "text": "5.调查宝箱（42.19），选“是”获得【古代王族的血壶】。",
      "type": "step-acquisition",
      "sourceLines": [
        17
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 18,
      "text": "6.与天空的看守者（12.32）对话，交出【古代王族的血壶】并通过栅栏。",
      "type": "gate-exchange",
      "sourceLines": [
        18
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 19,
      "text": "7.通过（12.37）处楼梯下楼，调查宝箱（11.8），选“是”获得【古代莎草制绷带】。",
      "type": "step-acquisition",
      "sourceLines": [
        19
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 20,
      "text": "8.通过（10.11）处楼梯上楼，持有【古代莎草制绷带】与天空的看守者对话，通过栅栏。",
      "type": "held-item-gate",
      "sourceLines": [
        20
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 21,
      "text": "9.调查宝箱（42.19），选“是”获得【古代王族的血壶】。",
      "type": "step-acquisition",
      "sourceLines": [
        21
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 22,
      "text": "10.与大地的看守者（66.24）对话，交出【古代莎草制绷带】并通过栅栏。",
      "type": "gate-exchange",
      "sourceLines": [
        22
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 23,
      "text": "11.通过（34.12）处楼梯上楼，通过（73.30）处楼梯下楼。",
      "type": "route-step",
      "sourceLines": [
        23
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 24,
      "text": "12.调查宝箱（16.4），选“是”获得【泛红光的古代石】。",
      "type": "step-acquisition",
      "sourceLines": [
        24
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 25,
      "text": "13.凑齐 【增效毒蝎血清】、【泛红光的古代石】，返回 沙漠之庙 地下6层，与离（12.10）对话，进入战斗",
      "type": "item-gated-battle-entry",
      "sourceLines": [
        25
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 26,
      "text": "◆战斗信息：",
      "type": "battle-heading",
      "sourceLines": [
        26
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 27,
      "text": "LV.100狂战将军，血量约20000，邪魔系，全属性40；技能：攻击、乾坤一掷EX（10魔）、恢复魔法LV3、",
      "type": "battle-enemy",
      "sourceLines": [
        27
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 28,
      "text": "即死魔法LV3（10魔）、魔法封印LV5（7回合）、EXP抽取魔法LV10、戒骄戒躁",
      "type": "battle-enemy-continuation",
      "sourceLines": [
        28
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 29,
      "text": "◇打法建议：战栗BOSS，人物10级战栗显示8以内，宠物V级战栗显示6以内，主要限制技能乾坤一掷EX、即死魔法",
      "type": "strategy-note",
      "sourceLines": [
        29
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 30,
      "text": "注：需要凑齐2个道具，否则不能得到称号，陪打号不需要道具。",
      "type": "reward-gate-note",
      "sourceLines": [
        30
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 31,
      "text": "14.战斗胜利之后，与离对话，交出【泛红光的古代石】、【增效毒蝎血清】，",
      "type": "completion-exchange",
      "sourceLines": [
        31
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 32,
      "text": "获取称号“来自【离】的赞许”，并传送到索奇亚，任务完成。",
